# The OpenSEO image this repo runs and the upstream release whose compose file it vendors: one line per field, "key
# value...". Read only through scripts/openseo/lib/pin.sh, which accepts nothing but the shapes it lists.
#
# image is a rolling tag on GHCR. 0 moves to each 0.x release and to no other build; latest moves with every merge to
# upstream's main branch, so the pin does not name it. Following 0 is a deliberate exception to pinning by digest, and
# render writes it to every host's env file. The stack's other two images stay pinned by digest, as upstream's compose
# file has them. tag, commit, and the sha256 line record the vendored compose.yaml, which is upstream's
# deploy/standalone/compose.yaml at commit, byte for byte.

tag v0.1.25
